{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q425845","formula":"C₁₆H₃₀O","hill":"C16H30O","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":30.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Bombykol","ru":"Бомбикол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Bombykol is a pheromone released by the female silkworm moth to attract mates. It is also the sex pheromone in the wild silk moth (Bombyx mandarina). Discovered by Adolf Butenandt in 1959, it was the first pheromone to be characterized chemically.","ru":"Бомбикол — феромон (половой аттрактант) тутового шелкопряда Bombyx mori и павлиноглазок Antheraea polyphemus. Выделяется самками насекомых и привлекает самцов в чрезвычайно низких концентрациях. Бомбикол был идентифицирован как феромон Адольфом Бутенандтом в 1959 г., а его структура установлена в 1961 г."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":445128,"mass":238.41,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCC/C=C\\C=C\\CCCCCCCCCO","inchikey":"CIVIWCVVOFNUST-SCFJQAPRSA-N","iupac":"(10E,12Z)-hexadeca-10,12-dien-1-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"445128","atoms":47,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":8.128,"y":1.377,"z":0.564,"el":"O"},{"x":2.184,"y":-0.479,"z":-0.387,"el":"C"},{"x":1.363,"y":-1.773,"z":-0.421,"el":"C"},{"x":3.68,"y":-0.717,"z":-0.169,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.154,"y":-1.593,"z":-0.549,"el":"C"},{"x":4.491,"y":0.58,"z":-0.077,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.926,"y":-2.917,"z":-0.516,"el":"C"},{"x":5.976,"y":0.344,"z":0.221,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.443,"y":-2.737,"z":-0.637,"el":"C"},{"x":6.764,"y":1.648,"z":0.275,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.041,"y":-1.967,"z":0.506,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.682,"y":-0.798,"z":0.359,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.249,"y":-0.064,"z":1.467,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.092,"y":1.783,"z":-0.004,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.962,"y":2.77,"z":-0.299,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.89,"y":1.105,"z":1.321,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.147,"y":3.438,"z":-1.653,"el":"C"},{"x":2.034,"y":0.067,"z":-1.327,"